{"created": "2026-09-01T17:33:01.563804+00:00", "modified": "2026-09-02T00:48:15.474254+00:00", "id": 22233383, "conceptrecid": "21633063", "doi": "10.5281/zenodo.22233383", "conceptdoi": "10.5281/zenodo.21633063", "doi_url": "https://doi.org/10.5281/zenodo.22233383", "metadata": {"title": "Dataset for Sampling hard circuits with verifiably high fidelity", "doi": "10.5281/zenodo.22233383", "publication_date": "2026-09-01", "description": "<p>This is the dataset for the preprint <a href=\"https://arxiv.org/abs/2607.25941\">\"Sampling hard circuits with verifiably high fidelity\"</a>. This includes data and circuit for the second version, which performs experiments on a 64 X 73 circuit arranged on a loop.</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<table>\n<tbody>\n<tr>\n<td>Filename</td>\n<td>Experiment</td>\n<td>Description</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>amp_dump.pkl</td>\n<td>Experiment 2</td>\n<td>A pickle file containing the XEB amplitudes for the 64 X 73 loop circuit when doped with 75 T gates, in the same order as the bitstrings.</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>fig3_data.pkl</td>\n<td>Experiment 1</td>\n<td>A pickle file containing relevant data to calculate the fidelities as presented in Figure 3 of the paper.</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>fig4_all_syndromes.pkl</td>\n<td>Experiment 2</td>\n<td>A pickle file of all the syndromes presented in Figure 4 of the paper.</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>fig4_data.pkl</td>\n<td>Experiment 2</td>\n<td>A pickle file containing relevant data to calculate the fidelities as presented in Figure 4 of the paper.</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>loop64_5t.qasm</td>\n<td>Experiment 2</td>\n<td>Qasm file for the 64 X 73 loop circuit with 5 T gates.</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>loop64_75t.qasm</td>\n<td>Experiment 2</td>\n<td>Qasm file for the 64 X 73 loop circuit with 75 T gates.</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>loop64_314t.qasm</td>\n<td>Experiment 1 &amp; 2</td>\n<td>Qasm file for the 64 X 73 loop circuit with 314 T gates.</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table>\n<p>All pickle files use python version 3.13 and numpy version 2.3.0</p>", "access_right": "open", "creators": [{"name": "Chung, Jay-U", "affiliation": "IBM (United States)"}, {"name": "Martiel, Simon", "affiliation": "IBM (France)"}, {"name": "Seif, Alireza", "affiliation": "IBM (United States)"}, {"name": "Ghosh, Soumik", "affiliation": "University of Chicago"}, {"name": "Hincks, Ian", "affiliation": "IBM (United States)"}, {"name": "Deshpande, Abhinav", "affiliation": "IBM (United States)"}, {"name": "Manabe, Hidetaka", "affiliation": "Singapore University of Technology and Design"}, {"name": "Gu, Hanfeng", "affiliation": "Nvidia (United States)"}, {"name": "Pan, Feng", "affiliation": "Singapore University of Technology and Design"}, {"name": "Fefferman, Bill", "affiliation": "University of Chicago"}, {"name": "Gambetta, Jay", "affiliation": "IBM (United States)"}, {"name": "Javadi-Abhari, Ali", "affiliation": "IBM (United States)"}], "related_identifiers": [{"identifier": "arXiv:2607.25941", "relation": "isSupplementTo", "resource_type": "publication-preprint", "scheme": "arxiv"}], "dates": [{"type": "created"}], "custom": {"code:programmingLanguage": [{"id": "python", "title": {"en": "Python"}}], "code:developmentStatus": {"id": "active", "title": {"en": "Active"}}}, "resource_type": {"title": "Dataset", "type": "dataset"}, "license": {"id": "cc-by-4.0"}, "relations": {"version": [{"index": 1, "is_last": true, "parent": {"pid_type": "recid", "pid_value": "21633063"}}]}}, "title": "Dataset for Sampling hard circuits with verifiably high fidelity", "links": {"self": "https://zenodo.org/api/records/22233383", "self_html": "https://zenodo.org/records/22233383", "preview_html": "https://zenodo.org/records/22233383?preview=1", "doi": "https://doi.org/10.5281/zenodo.22233383", "self_doi": "https://doi.org/10.5281/zenodo.22233383", "self_doi_html": "https://zenodo.org/doi/10.5281/zenodo.22233383", "reserve_doi": "https://zenodo.org/api/records/22233383/draft/pids/doi", "parent": "https://zenodo.org/api/records/21633063", 